OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum military base housing
OL,4,Adocuments published
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has released documents
OL,7,Frelating to its "urgent" plans to build
OL,8,Fasylum seekers' accommodation on a
OL,9,Fformer military base.
OL,11,FThe Home Office is proposing to convert
OL,12,Fexisting buildings and provide
OL,13,Faccommodation for up to 1,256 men at
OL,14,Fthe Ministry of Defence (MoD) site near
OL,15,FBicester, Oxfordshire.
OL,17,FIt has made an Urgent Crown Development
OL,18,Fapplication, a special procedure to
OL,19,Ffast track the process due to its
OL,20,F"national importance".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
